From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp100: Export tr1::_Xfunc, _Mutex(_Uninitialized), _GetCurrentThreadId and the unsigned short reader.

msvcp100: tr1::_Xfunc (throws std::bad_function_call, as
_Xbad_function_call does in the later libraries), _Mutex(_Uninitialized)
(leaves the object as it is; the static mutexes are set up by
_Mutex_ctor), details::_GetCurrentThreadId as in msvcp110, and the
unsigned short operator>>(unsigned short &) and time_get::get with a
format, as msvcp110 has them.
---
 dlls/msvcp100/msvcp100.spec | 20 ++++++++++----------
 dlls/msvcp90/misc.c         | 15 +++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 25 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

